    "body": "The One-line portfolio is now the default and carries motion through projects, problems, services, process, about, contact and footer. Titles reveal through masks; previews unfold inside stable clickable frames; section rules, process paths and chapter navigation connect the page. The original style remains selectable.\n\nHero progress follows native scrolling with short time-based smoothing and bounded lag. Geometry is cached, SVG tracer sampling avoids path layout reads in each frame, and completed hero states stop repainting. Animations pause when the style or browser tab is hidden. Reduced motion shows all content immediately; mobile removes parallax and shortens travel.\n\nValidation: build and eight data/geometry tests pass, including frame-independent following and cubic endpoints. Browser checks cover 320/390/768/1440px in normal/reduced modes, resize during morph, first-click order updates around 79% progress, retained demo/form state, project opening during entrance, Escape cleanup and brief generation. Desktop/mobile recordings are in the local delivery package. See MOTION-FULL-PAGE.md for scope and verification limits.\n",
